  "body": "NEW PRICE - $899,000 | NEARLY NEW, SINGLE-LEVEL LIVING\r\n\r\nImagine spending Christmas and the summer holidays in your new home, with the unpacking behind you, the sunshine streaming in and beautiful green outlooks to enjoy.\r\n\r\nOnly 18 months old, this contemporary three-bedroom home offers the perfect combination of modern comfort, easy-care living and a wonderfully open setting.\r\n\r\nWith the golf course stretching out behind the property and a reserve to the front, there's a real sense of space and tranquillity that's not always easy to find.\r\n\r\nA home made for easy living.\r\n\r\nThe sunny, open-plan living area flows effortlessly onto an elevated deck, creating a lovely space for everyday living, relaxed evenings and summer entertaining.\r\n\r\nAt the heart of the home is a beautifully finished kitchen, complete with a central island, timber cabinetry, stone-look benchtops and Bosch appliances.\r\n\r\nThe master bedroom has its own ensuite, walk-in wardrobe and direct deck access. Two further double bedrooms, a family bathroom, separate laundry/storage and internal-access garage complete the practical single-level layout.\r\n\r\nWhat makes this home special?\r\n\r\n• Only 18 months old - modern and low maintenance\r\n• Golf-course outlook behind and reserve to the front\r\n• Light-filled, sunny open-plan living\r\n• Elevated deck with beautiful green views\r\n• Three bedrooms and two bathrooms\r\n• Modern kitchen with Bosch appliances\r\n• Single-level convenience\r\n• Heat pumps and central vacuum system\r\n• Internal-access garage plus off-street parking\r\n\r\nCould you be home for Christmas?\r\n\r\nNow offered at $899,000, this is a wonderful opportunity to secure a nearly new home in a peaceful Gulf Harbour setting.\r\n\r\nWith our next move being into a rental property, we're not waiting to purchase another home. This gives us the flexibility to accommodate a straightforward, potentially quick settlement for buyers hoping to move before Christmas.\r\n\r\nYou could be unpacked, settled and enjoying your new surroundings in time for the holidays.\r\n\r\nCome and see what makes this such a lovely place to call home.\r\n\r\nContact us to request the property information pack or to arrange a private viewing if the open home time doesn't suit.\r\n\r\nPrivate sale - no agents please.",
